"你已经找到照片上的那个女孩了吗？","C":"你现在还饿吗？","D":"今天来吃饭的人多吗？","E":"这碗汤是不是有点儿凉了？"}},"HSK3-C01-R-V1":{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"双","B":"重要","C":"接","D":"张","E":"渴","F":"丢"}},"HSK3-C01-R-V2":{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"门口","B":"简单","C":"马上","D":"以为","E":"外卖","F":"饮料"}},"HSK3-C01-R-T57":{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-T57","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"上星期，我去机场接一个第一次来中国的朋友。我记得他会带一个蓝色箱子，就一直站在三号出口等。后来他给我发消息，说下飞机后箱子找不到了，正在请工作人员帮忙。我请他在那里等，自己走过去找他。"},"HSK3-C01-R-T59":{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-T59","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"下午，同事们准备开个小会，中午就一起点了外卖。小周想多点几个菜，经理说大家下午还要工作，吃简单一点儿就行。后来他们点了四份饭，又加了两杯茶。送餐的人到得比他们想的早，饭送来时，会议还没开始。"}},"examples":{"EM":{"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"谢谢你帮我把行李搬上楼。","answer":"B"},"EV1":{"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"桌上那一（　）照片是我的。","answer":"D"},"EV2":{"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：不想出去吃的话，我们可以点（　）。／乙：好，你来选吧。","answer":"E"},"E3":{"passage":"我和小陈约好下午两点见。刚才他来电话，说路上有点儿慢，让我先进去找座位。","question":"小陈希望我先做什么？","options":{"A":"找座位","B":"给司机打电话","C":"到门口等"},"answer":"A"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-31","number":31,"lesson":1,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"这个黑箱子是你的吗？","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-32","number":32,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"您好，可以先看一下菜单吗？","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-33","number":33,"lesson":1,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"小李在哪儿工作？今天能见到他吗？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-34","number":34,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"您要用筷子还是勺子？","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-35","number":35,"lesson":1,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M1","prompt":"我快到车站了，再等我十分钟。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-36","number":36,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M2","prompt":"送到公司吧。我今天晚上还要工作。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-37","number":37,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M2","prompt":"不少，只剩下门口那张小桌子了。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-38","number":38,"lesson":1,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M2","prompt":"找到了。她就是坐在窗边看书的那位。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-39","number":39,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M2","prompt":"有点儿。请问能不能给我热一下？","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-40","number":40,"lesson":2,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-M2","prompt":"不饿了，我刚吃了一碗面。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-41","number":41,"lesson":1,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"这是很（　）的东西，请你一定放好。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-42","number":42,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"吃了那么多东西，我有点儿口（　），想喝杯水。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-43","number":43,"lesson":1,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"周五我要去机场（　）一个同学。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-44","number":44,"lesson":1,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"上车以前请检查护照，小心别（　）了。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-45","number":45,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V1","prompt":"桌上已经有三（　）筷子，再拿一双来。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-46","number":46,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：要不要喝点儿（　）？／乙：不用了，喝水就行。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-47","number":47,"lesson":1,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：你怎么还没出来？／乙：我（　）你要晚一点儿来呢。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-48","number":48,"lesson":1,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：我们在哪儿见面？／乙：我在商店（　）等你。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-49","number":49,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：那道菜难做吗？／乙：很（　），你看我做一遍就会了。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-50","number":50,"lesson":2,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-V2","prompt":"甲：再过五分钟就关门了。／乙：好，我（　）下来拿东西。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-51","number":51,"lesson":1,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我以前没见过小张，只看过他的照片。今天到他家时，开门的那个人跟照片上很像，结果他是小张的哥哥。","question":"给他开门的是谁？","options":{"A":"小张","B":"小张的朋友","C":"小张的哥哥"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-52","number":52,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"这家小店的面要十分钟才能做好，饭已经做好了。小王还有十分钟就要上车，所以只买了一份饭。","question":"小王为什么没买面？","options":{"A":"他时间不够","B":"面太贵","C":"店里没有面"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-53","number":53,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"小林本来想在学校东边租房子，可那边晚上车太多。最后他搬到了西边一个小区，走到学校也只要十几分钟。","question":"小林现在住在哪里？","options":{"A":"学校里面","B":"学校东边","C":"学校西边"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-54","number":54,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我们住的宾馆早上七点才有早饭。我明天六点半就要出发，所以今天下午去买了些面包，打算带在路上吃。","question":"他为什么买面包？","options":{"A":"宾馆的早饭不好吃","B":"出发太早","C":"朋友喜欢吃面包"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-55","number":55,"lesson":5,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"小安喜欢拍照，可每次出去都走得比大家慢，因为她常常停下来拍路边的花。跟她一起出去，要记得多留点儿时间。","question":"小安为什么走得慢？","options":{"A":"她常停下来拍照","B":"她找不到路","C":"她在等车"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-56","number":56,"lesson":6,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"从车站出来先向左走，经过一个小公园，再过马路。学校就在银行旁边，门口有两棵大树，很容易找到。","question":"学校在哪里？","options":{"A":"银行旁边","B":"公园后面","C":"车站里面"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-57","number":57,"lesson":1,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-T57","question":"我开始在什么地方等朋友？","options":{"A":"二号出口","B":"飞机上","C":"三号出口"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-58","number":58,"lesson":1,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-T57","question":"朋友为什么没马上到出口？","options":{"A":"他忘了出口号码","B":"他在找箱子","C":"他没看到消息"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-59","number":59,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-T59","question":"经理为什么想吃得简单一点儿？","options":{"A":"下午还要工作","B":"茶还没送来","C":"店里没有菜"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-R-60","number":60,"lesson":2,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C01-R-T59","question":"饭是什么时候送来的？","options":{"A":"开会以后","B":"会议开始前","C":"会议快结束时"},"answer":"B"}]},"writing":{"examples":{"pinyinCharacter":{"prompt":"请把你的东西（　）在这儿。","pinyin":"fàng","answer":"放"},"pictureSentence":{"word":"看书","image":"assets/images/w-example.jpg","answer":"小男孩正在看书。"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-61","number":61,"lesson":1,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"谢谢你给我这么多帮（　）。","pinyin":"zhù","answer":"助","reference":"谢谢你给我这么多帮助。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-62","number":62,"lesson":2,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"客人进门后，服务员拿了两份菜（　）过来。","pinyin":"dān","answer":"单","reference":"客人进门后，服务员拿了两份菜单过来。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-63","number":63,"lesson":1,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"请把（　）照放好，一会儿要用。","pinyin":"hù","answer":"护","reference":"请把护照放好，一会儿要用。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-64","number":64,"lesson":2,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"他出了不少汗，又累又（　），进门就喝了一大杯水。","pinyin":"kě","answer":"渴","reference":"他出了不少汗，又累又渴，进门就喝了一大杯水。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-65","number":65,"lesson":2,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"晚上除了茶，我们还准备了一些别的（　）料。","pinyin":"yǐn","answer":"饮","reference":"晚上除了茶，我们还准备了一些别的饮料。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-66","number":66,"lesson":1,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"行李","image":"assets/images/c01-w-66.jpg","reference":"他正在把要带的行李放进行李箱。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-67","number":67,"lesson":2,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"菜单","image":"assets/images/c01-w-67.jpg","reference":"我们先看看菜单上有什么菜吧。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-68","number":68,"lesson":2,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"勺子","image":"assets/images/c01-w-68.jpg","reference":"她用勺子把汤盛到碗里。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-69","number":69,"lesson":2,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"蛋糕","image":"assets/images/c01-w-69.jpg","reference":"店员切了一块蛋糕给客人。"},{"id":"HSK3-C01-W-70","number":70,"lesson":2,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"筷子","image":"assets/images/c01-w-70.jpg","reference":"他用筷子夹起了一块豆腐。"}]},"title":"第1次课 · 机场和点餐","writingRubric":{"2":"使用指定词，句意完整，内容与图片相符。意思正确的其他句子也可得分。","1":"使用指定词，能看出主要图意，语序、用词或搭配有明显错误。","0":"空白、遗漏指定词、句意无法判断，或内容与图片不符。"}}
